<!--
    `buk in.` — the real letterforms from docs/assets/buk-in.svg, trimmed to a tight viewport
    so it has no dead space to centre around.

    This replaces the buildAnnotatedString imitation the footer used to draw, which faked the
    mark with a system italic and was never going to match a bespoke script `in`.

    The fill below is never rendered: every call site draws this through `Icon`, which applies
    a tint from the theme. It is baked here only because a VectorDrawable requires one. That
    is also why this is a drawable rather than an ImageVector — the splash needs an
    AnimatedVectorDrawable, which is XML-only, and carrying the same path data a second time
    as Kotlin string constants would be strictly worse.
-->
